## 7. Create VNet and Private Endpoint Subnet

```bash
VNET="lab08-vnet"
SUBNET="private-endpoint-subnet"

az network vnet create \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --name "$VNET" \
  --location "northcentralus" \
  --address-prefix 10.8.0.0/16 \
  --subnet-name "$SUBNET" \
  --subnet-prefix 10.8.1.0/24
```

VNet:

```text
lab08-vnet
10.8.0.0/16
```

Subnet:

```text
private-endpoint-subnet
10.8.1.0/24
```

---

## 8. Create Private Endpoint

First, get the SQL Logical Server resource ID:

```bash
SQL_SERVER_ID=$(az sql server show \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --name "$SQL_SERVER" \
  --query id \
  -o tsv)
```

Create the Private Endpoint:

```bash
PE="lab08-private-endpoint"

az network private-endpoint create \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --name "$PE" \
  --location "northcentralus" \
  --vnet-name "$VNET" \
  --subnet "$SUBNET" \
  --private-connection-resource-id "$SQL_SERVER_ID" \
  --group-id sqlServer \
  --connection-name "lab08-sql-connection"
```

Private Endpoint:

```text
lab08-private-endpoint
```

Private IP:

```text
10.8.1.4
```

Connection:

```text
lab08-sql-connection
Status: Approved
Provisioning: Succeeded
```

### Important concept

The Private Endpoint is connected to the **SQL Logical Server**, not directly to `lab08-db`.

The traffic path is:

```text
10.8.1.4
    ↓
Private Endpoint
    ↓
SQL Logical Server
    ↓
lab08-db
```

---

## 9. Private DNS

Create Private DNS Zone:

```bash
DNS_ZONE="privatelink.database.windows.net"

az network private-dns zone create \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --name "$DNS_ZONE"
```

Link the DNS Zone to the VNet:

```bash
az network private-dns link vnet create \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --zone-name "$DNS_ZONE" \
  --name "lab08-dns-link" \
  --virtual-network "$VNET" \
  --registration-enabled false
```

Then link the Private Endpoint to the DNS Zone:

```bash
az network private-endpoint dns-zone-group create \
  --resource-group "$RG" \
  --endpoint-name "$PE" \
  --name "lab08-dns-zone-group" \
  --private-dns-zone "$DNS_ZONE" \
  --zone-name "privatelink-database-windows-net"
```

DNS record:

```text
lab08-sql-74518410.privatelink.database.windows.net
        ↓
10.8.1.4
```

### DNS flow

```text
Client
  ↓
lab08-sql-74518410.database.windows.net
  ↓
Private DNS
  ↓
10.8.1.4
  ↓
Private Endpoint
  ↓
SQL Logical Server
  ↓
lab08-db
```

